  "properties": {
    "title": "GRID3 COD - Health Zones v9.0",
    "description": "The GRID3 COD - Health Zones v9.0 dataset consists of health zone boundaries with name and other related attributes for all the twenty-six provinces in the Democratic Republic of the Congo (COD). The current version supersedes the GRID3 COD - Health Zones v8.0 < https://doi.org/10.7916/asa4-jc67 >. The following changes were made: - The data for Haut-Katanga, Haut-Lomami, Ituri, Kwango, Lomami, Maniema, and Tanganyika provinces were updated Health zone names were updated. This dataset should be considered operational; it has not been fully validated by government authorities. Keywords: Health Boundaries, Health Zones",
    "license": "other",
